WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.800
Start from a ready-made template that runs on sample data.

2
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:11.267
It opens on the canvas, one clear step at a time.

3
00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:18.601
Add a step from the list and drop it on the canvas.

4
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.600
Connect it to what comes before and set its condition.

5
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.600
Press Run: the steps light up one by one.

6
00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:37.649
The result appears as soon as the run ends.

7
00:00:40.735 --> 00:00:44.677
Open any step to see what went in and what came out.

8
00:00:44.717 --> 00:00:47.461
Every run is kept in your history.

9
00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:50.401
Share a copy with another workspace.
